{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_017_01_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:862ddc9a512fdd2e0c8d52261d5de82db4276bff692d595f1806f8fd8e784203",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_e:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_e:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f030c233632b71672d026934276b163bf5df6d5dc27ed481c81029647c3be7ce",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー君！\n吾辈的全天跟拍采访，反响如何喵？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_e:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8589e749fd5a131c63c07a1ce8898aaf091c21c832f7f940e4700b8b21174af",
      "text": "很多观众好评说能看到桐生先生各色各样的表情，\n非常开心哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccbc950e5a63af0209a670e5074d26b48d617dbeda6d8baf5a89761f4eaf7cf5",
      "text": "我想以此节目为契机，\n对桐生先生感兴趣的人一定变多了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_e:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0098a7ec3005f6dde970f39a604b0f279a0ef478e100d4af3f39acc9224b4876",
      "text": "喵呵呵呵，大成功了喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c2048483433bb37c6a73da0056e7347c1d89867492531c2fc2a401c18f05730",
      "text": "作为偶像不仅完成了有趣的工作，\n还到手了满满的新素材……不仅如此。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_e:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fd896053ad23c0291a656469a44d93c008c066ca32aaa696318280d7198ac7c",
      "text": "还能把●●●●プロデューサー君\n招待到家里喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_e:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:975c236877fbff756a747ccf8428bab4ac994faa7be19dbe00e48838dab2a5c9",
      "text": "净是好事，\n非常开心喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_e:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57352d12d42236ad785c2a03b54604530553cdd407504466578fc8fb190f55c8",
      "text": "吾辈还想做各种各样其他的工作呢。\n师父也叹着气支持我了喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_e:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1549174a557f77aeb6d96ba3d3b60298250a226b7eb276087cabf70c3edc7091",
      "text": "那可太感激了。正好有给桐生先生的\n新工作邀请送到了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_e:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0480caf9fd7cbd9f7af7f9f74e11dadfa5ee7a41b2e85d1783067406a8db5fa",
      "text": "喵喵～！\n快跟吾辈详细说说喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
